[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8477.59, "timestamp": "02:21:17", "text": "什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8479.51, "timestamp": "02:21:19", "text": "只瞄准头部射击。 只瞄准"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8481.75, "timestamp": "02:21:21", "text": "头部射击。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8490.55, "timestamp": "02:21:30", "text": "呃，如果你瞄准的是头发，那它就会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8493.67, "timestamp": "02:21:33", "text": "像红色的一样更浓稠，对吧？   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8500.23, "timestamp": "02:21:40", "text": "是的，这是游戏的基本知识。"}]